			(property "Description" "Alps Alpine SKRPANE010 SPST-NO momentary tactile switch; logical connection 1 maps manufacturer terminals 1 and 2, and logical connection 2 maps manufacturer terminals 3 and 4; top push, 1.57 N, 0.2 mm travel, 1,000,000 cycles, 4.2 x 3.2 x 2.5 mm"
